# Runtime, credentials, licensed assets and generated productions stay out.
#
# This file only keeps *untracked* files untracked. It cannot stop a path that is
# already in the index - `git rm --cached` is required for that - so the published
# surface is decided by `scripts/Test-UETemplatePublishSurface.ps1`, which reads
# `git ls-files` and applies its own case-insensitive rules. Do not treat adding a
# line here as a guarantee that the file cannot be published.
Production/*
!Production/PLACEHOLDER.md
Out/
Art/
Saved/
Binaries/
Intermediate/
DerivedDataCache/
.vs/
.idea/

# Engine and licensed content shapes.
*.uasset
*.umap
*.fbx
*.psd
*.wav
*.mp3
*.mp4
*.mov
*.zip
*.pak
*.utoc
*.ucas

# Offline handoff / distribution shapes. README.md documents the bundle as a
# normal offline handoff artifact, so it can legitimately exist in a checkout;
# it must never be committed.
*.bundle
*.7z
*.rar
*.tar.gz
*.tgz
*.exe
*.dll
*.pdb
*.lib
*.so
*.dylib

# Credentials and secret-shaped paths.
LEASE*.json
.env*
auth.json
*credentials*
*chrome-profile*
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
*.jks
*.p8
*.ppk
secrets.json
secrets.yaml
secrets.yml
secret.json
secret.yaml
secret.yml
token.json
service-account.json
id_rsa
id_ed25519
id_ecdsa
id_dsa
.netrc
_netrc
.npmrc
.pypirc
client_secret*
api-token.txt
GH_TOKEN
keystore
.htpasswd
.DS_Store
